    "prompt": "Transform this photo into a minimal hand-drawn illustration on cream textured paper background. Keep only the main subject's pose and silhouette, remove all background.主体居中，周围大量留白. Use thin black sketchy contour lines with a loose, imperfect hand-drawn feel. Fill with a few flat color blocks extracted from the original photo，色块不完全填满线条边界，要有手绘平涂的随意感。色块不超过5种颜色，减少阴影细节。low saturation, slightly irregular edges like marker.人物简化为基础形状，面部特征尽量少（点眼、简单的鼻子、小嘴），比例略显笨拙。如果有眼睛就保留眼镜 。A few minimal environment lines at the bottom. Large empty space around the subject. Add elegant English title text at the bottom in serif font. Nostalgic sketchbook aesthetic, no shading, no gradients, no realistic details.\n\nNegative: photorealistic, detailed background, facial features, eyes, nose, mouth, complex shading, 3D, vector art, clean perfect lines, digital painting, gradients, realistic texture, crowded, blurry, watermark",
